{"slug":"greetings-starter-l9","artistFeel":"The Weeknd","beat":"Chill Slow","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 9","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":9,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Pop","lyrics":"[Intro]\nHere we go… ¡Vamos!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nOn the phone with grandma.\n\n[Verse]\nGood morning… Buenos días\nShe says with a smile.\nThank you… Gracias\nFor calling me for a while.\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nShe laughs and says.\nExcuse me… Perdón\nIf I sound in a daze.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nOn the phone with grandma.\n\n[Verse]\nHey, listen… Oye\nShe tells me a tale.\nTell me… Cuéntame\nAbout your day, don't fail.\nGood… Buenas\nShe always makes it bright.\nOkay… Vale\nEverything's alright.\n\n[Bridge]\nOf course… Claro\nI tell her all my plans.\nTake care… Cuídate\nShe adds with gentle hands.\nYou're welcome… De nada\nI say with pride.\nHow's it going?… ¿Qué tal?\nShe asks with love inside.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar\nOne, two, three… Uno, dos, tres\nOn the phone with grandma.","vocab":[{"es":"buenas","en":"good (informal greeting)"},{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"perdón","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thank you"},{"es":"vale","en":"okay"},{"es":"claro","en":"of course"},{"es":"oye","en":"hey (listen)"},{"es":"cuídate","en":"take care"},{"es":"cuéntame","en":"tell me"},{"es":"¿qué tal?","en":"how's it going?"},{"es":"perfecto","en":"perfect"},{"es":"venga","en":"come on"},{"es":"espera","en":"wait"},{"es":"suerte","en":"good luck"},{"es":"adiós","en":"goodbye"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.079,"end":1.199,"loss":4.406311650755544},{"start":1.199,"end":3.019,"loss":6.920023600260417},{"start":3.019,"end":5.159,"loss":2.932291743249